and comparison key (src/ariadne/qlik/expressions.py), the ownership scan
(src/ariadne/qlik/ownership.py), the bulk script read with its permission
handling (src/ariadne/qlik/bulk.py) and the REST and Engine helpers are ported
from the author's BI Governance Studio (the Eunomia repository), by the same
author. They were rewritten for a library without a GUI; the rules they encode
are unchanged and documented in CLAUDE.md.

